{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/073-da-che/fangyurun-yuanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/073-da-che/fangyurun-yuanshi/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 大車 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 王風 · 大車 · 汇集《诗经原始(上下)》关于《大車》的 4 条注释，含 4 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"073-da-che","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/073-da-che/fangyurun-yuanshi","poem":{"id":"073-da-che","title":"大車","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"wangfeng","path":["風","王風","大車"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"大車檻檻","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"毳衣如菼","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"豈不爾思","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"畏子不敢","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"大車啍啍","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"毳衣如璊","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"豈不爾思","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"畏子不奔","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"穀則異室","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"死則同穴","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"謂予不信","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"有如皦日","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":4,"glossCount":4},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"大車㊟征夫歎也。","targetNotes":"篇首题注。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标题段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"右《大車》三章，章四句。此詩若從《序》言，以爲「陳古以刺今」，則無以處「穀則異室」之言。蓋夫婦雖有别，亦何至異室而分居？如從《集傳》，以爲「淫奔有所畏」，則無以釋「死則同穴」之語。蓋男女縱有情，誰爲收屍而合葬？此皆難以理論也。惟姚氏際恒云：「僞傳、説皆以爲周人從軍，訊其室家之詩，似可通。」此雖出於僞説，而詩意真切，詎得以其僞而少之歟？周衰世亂，征伐不一，周人從軍，迄無甯歲。恐此生永無團聚之期，故念其室家而與之訣絶如此。然其情亦可慘矣。","targetNotes":"通篇总评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 总评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":4,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"集釋大車〔姚氏際恒曰〕大車，牛車。毳衣〔姚氏際恒曰〕毳衣，毛布衣。菼〔《集傳》曰〕菼，蘆始生也。爾指室家。子指主之者。啍啍重遲之貌。〔孔氏穎達曰〕啍啍，行之貌，故爲重遲。上言行之聲，此言行之貌，互相見也。璊音門。〔孔氏穎達曰〕璊，玉頳色也。禾之赤苗謂之璊，玉色如之。穀生也。穴壙也。皦白也。","targetNotes":"集释原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":4,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"標韻檻二十九豏。菼二十七感。敢同。通韻。啍十三元。璊、奔並同。本韻。室四質。穴九屑。日四質。通韻。","targetNotes":"标韵原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标韵段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"标韵"}]}]}}}
